fer from the seed). Only the code's variables (the list of variables) are accepted. A missing required variable (N-08a admin_text; N-02's link belongs to its welcome e-mail only, E76) is VALIDATION_ERROR with details.missingVariables (MissingVariablesDetails); CHANNEL_NOT_ALLOWED carries ChannelNotAllowedDetails; TEMPLATE_SYNTAX_ERROR, TEMPLATE_UNKNOWN_VARIABLE and SMS_BODY_* carry TemplateFieldDetails. The texts are the club's languages (a template stored in other languages too is shown and saved in the club's). With SMS off the SMS cells are kept as stored. A stale version ? STALE_VERSION. The keys of a {gender, select, ?} are stored in lower case (female, male, other: the gender the engine renders). MessageTemplateChanged and CATALOG_CHANGED audit in the same transaction; the next notification uses the saved text (no template cache). Tenant comes from the JWT.","operationId":"updateMessageTemplate","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MessageTemplateUpdateRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"description":"MessageTemplateDetail","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MessageTemplateDetail"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR, TEMPLATE_SYNTAX_ERROR, TEMPLATE_UNKNOWN_VARIABLE, SMS_BODY_REQUIRED, SMS_BODY_TOO_LONG","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"STALE_VERSION","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"CHANNEL_NOT_ALLOWED, TEMPLATE_MANDATORY","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError