 (PlacementBlockedDetails: the critical warnings); a forced one audits COURSE_FORCED_PLACEMENT. warningThresholdM defaults to courses.defaultWarningThresholdM; status defaults to DRAFT and mode to TRAINING. Publishes PlacementCreated{placementId, ringId, courseId, warnings[]}.","operationId":"createPlacement","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string"}}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PlacementRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"description":"S16 Placement","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Placement"}}}},"400":{"description":"VALIDATION_ERROR","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"403":{"description":"FORBIDDEN, IMPERSONATION_DENIED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"404":{"description":"NOT_FOUND, MODULE_DISABLED, COURSE_NOT_VISIBLE","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"409":{"description":"STALE_VERSION","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"422":{"description":"PLACEMENT_BLOCKED, RING_WITHOUT_GEOMETRY, PLACEMENT_RING_MISMATCH","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"501":{"description":"NOT_IMPLEMENTED","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"401":{"description":"Unauthorized","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"429":{"description":"Too Many Requests","headers":{"Retry-After":{"description":"Seconds before retrying","schema":{"type":"integer","format":"int32"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"500":{"description":"Internal Server Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ApiError"}}}},"4XX":{"de